    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/b8e6ffad1585b5596be0f3b9b17e3804.avif?t=1752370485\" width=624 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ball type game where you stall the ball, spike the ball, or stop the ball from hitting the ground :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weird hybrid of hacky sack, volley ball, &amp; other ball games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >fast paced action! ;0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/82bbdeb5a3495be5ab6c621c6618e790.poster.avif?t=1752370485\" width=230 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/82bbdeb5a3495be5ab6c621c6618e790.webm?t=1752370485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/82bbdeb5a3495be5ab6c621c6618e790.mp4?t=1752370485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >local &amp; online multiplayer! :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more coming very very soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we hope you enjoy stalling! thanks :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/3ce4643565373566116d510dae62c811.avif?t=1752370485\" width=624 height=144 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/b8e6ffad1585b5596be0f3b9b17e3804.avif?t=1752370485\" width=624 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ball type game where you stall the ball, spike the ball, or stop the ball from hitting the ground :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weird hybrid of hacky sack, volley ball, &amp; other ball games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >fast paced action! ;0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/82bbdeb5a3495be5ab6c621c6618e790.poster.avif?t=1752370485\" width=230 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/82bbdeb5a3495be5ab6c621c6618e790.webm?t=1752370485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/82bbdeb5a3495be5ab6c621c6618e790.mp4?t=1752370485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >local &amp; online multiplayer! :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more coming very very soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we hope you enjoy stalling! thanks :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737110/extras/3ce4643565373566116d510dae62c811.avif?t=1752370485\" width=624 height=144 /></span></p>",
